# Design system

Before any UI, layout, or styling change, read `DESIGN.md` and follow it.

- Use only custom properties from `css/tokens.css`. No hard-coded colours, font stacks, spacing, or radii outside that file.
- Static HTML, CSS, and vanilla JS only. No frameworks, build step, or npm dependencies.
- Touch only the files named in the task. Leave other sections alone.
- Do not invent facts about the owner. Copy comes from `index.html`. If a fact is missing, write `TODO(abhishek): ...`.
- Motion is 150–250ms `ease-out`, opacity and 8px `translateY` only, with `prefers-reduced-motion` respected.
- `--signal` is the only accent.

```css
/* Wrong */
color: #B8401A;
font-family: Georgia, serif;
border-radius: 12px;

/* Right */
color: var(--signal);
font-family: var(--font-serif);
border-radius: var(--radius);
```
